{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878620/extras/4820cfe8dfc6dff6cb14b436b4a6824f.poster.avif?t=1757277005\" width=1600 height=892 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878620/extras/4820cfe8dfc6dff6cb14b436b4a6824f.webm?t=1757277005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878620/extras/4820cfe8dfc6dff6cb14b436b4a6824f.mp4?t=1757277005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Tape Rampage is a satirical idle incremental game about the glorious world of bureaucracy. Exploit interns, automate paperwork, and turn inefficiency into profit as you build your very own empire of red tape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff, unlock ridiculous upgrades and replace human workers with unreliable bots to maximize your office output. When your system collapses under its own absurdity, start fresh after promoting \u2013 keeping permanent bonuses and rising to even higher promotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satirical office setting full of absurd humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Artifacts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878620/extras/d0cb1f3d519c26f03ff5552c9c7c142e.poster.avif?t=1757277005\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878620/extras/d0cb1f3d519c26f03ff5552c9c7c142e.webm?t=1757277005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878620/extras/d0cb1f3d519c26f